       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day, which is twice the usual maximum of 3,200 mg/day for adults under medical supervision. The 1,600 mg single dose is also double the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg. At this level the risks of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events go up a lot, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **400 mg by mouth four times daily** (1,600 mg/day)\n- **800 mg by mouth three times daily** (2,400 mg/day)\n- **800 mg by mouth four times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the upper limit)\n- **1600 mg total per day**, divided into smaller doses\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it right away. If you do want 1600 mg four times daily, I'd need you to confirm that, and I'd suggest checking with pharmacy first."
